adjudication.rationale:
In packages/core/EventManager.ts the diff introduces:

```ts
const [mainHostDestinationCalendar] = evt.destinationCalendar ?? [];
if (evt.location === MeetLocationType && mainHostDestinationCalendar.integration !== "google_calendar") {
  ...
}
```

If `evt.destinationCalendar` is `null`, `undefined`, or an empty array, destructuring yields `mainHostDestinationCalendar === undefined`. The subsequent access `mainHostDestinationCalendar.integration` will throw `TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined`, which can abort booking creation. The diff elsewhere explicitly sets `destinationCalendar: []` in some cases, so this state is possible and verifiable from the changes.
